Basket: Test Store (id 35, grocery, LEAD, schedule today 00:00-23:59:59) + Spice Route Kitchen (id 49, food, schedule today 08:00-23:00 => closed now)
Rendered notice (a11y dump a11y-scope4-mixed-closed-food-notice-en.xml):
  "Store closed · opens at 00:00 · advance ordering unavailable"
Expected: the closed store is Spice Route (opens 08:00); the notice shows 00:00 = the LEAD store's opening time.
Source: UserApp/lib/features/checkout/widgets/time_slot_section.dart — ClosedStoreNoticeWidget.blocked(openingTime:
